    <li>treasure->补给</li>
  -->
  <OpportunitySite_ItemStash.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName(priority=1)->[asker_nameDef][stash]的[treasure]</li>
    <li>questName->[stash][treasure]</li>
    <li>stash->隐密</li>
    <li>stash->匿藏</li>
    <li>stash->收藏</li>
